      "description": "Goa is India's smallest state and a premier beach destination, known for its stunning coastline, vibrant nightlife, Portuguese colonial architecture, and spice plantations. The golden sands of Baga, Calangute, and Palolem attract millions of tourists. Beyond beaches, Goa offers historic forts, centuries-old churches, and a unique blend of Indian and Portuguese culture.",
      "best_season": "November to February",
