    {
      "name": "Jaipur",
      "country": "India",
      "description": "Jaipur, the Pink City, is the capital of Rajasthan and a jewel of India's Golden Triangle. Famous for its stunning palaces, ancient forts, and vibrant bazaars, it offers a rich tapestry of Rajput heritage. The Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal, and Jantar Mantar are UNESCO-recognised landmarks. The city is also known for its colourful textiles, gemstones, and traditional cuisine.",
      "best_season": "October to March",
