      "country": "India",
      "description": "Manali is a high-altitude resort town in Himachal Pradesh, nestled in the Kullu Valley at the northern end of the valley. A popular destination for adventure sports including skiing, trekking, paragliding, and river rafting, it is surrounded by snow-capped peaks, ancient cedar forests, and the Beas River. The Solang Valley and Rohtang Pass are iconic attractions.",
      "best_season": "October to June (avoid monsoon July-September)",
