    {
      "name": "Kerala",
      "country": "India",
      "description": "Kerala, God's Own Country, is celebrated for its serene backwaters, lush hill stations, pristine beaches, and rich cultural heritage. The tranquil backwaters of Alleppey, the spice gardens of Munnar, the wildlife of Periyar, and the beaches of Kovalam offer diverse experiences. Kerala cuisine, Kathakali dance, and Ayurvedic treatments are world-renowned.",
      "best_season": "September to March",
      "image_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Kerala_backwaters.jpg/1280px-Kerala_backwaters.jpg",
      "avg_daily_cost": 2800.00
