    {
      "name": "Udaipur",
      "country": "India",
      "description": "Udaipur, the City of Lakes, is one of Rajasthan's most romantic destinations. Dominated by shimmering lakes, the city is dotted with magnificent palaces, temples, and gardens. The Lake Palace rising from the waters of Lake Pichola, the City Palace complex, and the Sajjangarh Monsoon Palace are architectural marvels. The city is also a major hub for traditional arts and crafts.",
      "best_season": "September to March",
      "image_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Lake_Pichola_in_Udaipur.jpg/1280px-Lake_Pichola_in_Udaipur.jpg",
