    {
      "name": "Dubai",
      "country": "UAE",
      "description": "Dubai is a city of superlatives — the world's tallest building (Burj Khalifa), the largest mall, man-made islands, and a skyline that defies imagination. A global hub for luxury travel, shopping, and business, Dubai blends futuristic architecture with traditional Arabian heritage. The Gold Souk, Dubai Creek, Desert Safari, and world-class dining make it a complete destination.",
